sequenceDiagram
    participant S as Script
    participant L as LIBERO env
    participant R as robosuite OSC_POSE
    participant M as MuJoCo
    S->>L: OffScreenRenderEnv(bddl)
    L->>M: sahneyi kur (BDDL to MJCF)
    S->>L: reset() + set_init_state(init_states[0])
    L->>M: qpos ve qvel yukle
    L-->>S: obs: agentview_image, eye_in_hand, eef_pos, gripper_qpos
    loop her kontrol adimi (20 Hz)
        S->>L: step(action[7])
        L->>R: delta poz to eklem torklari
        R->>M: mj_step x 25
        M-->>L: yeni durum
        L->>L: render + success predicate
        L-->>S: obs, reward, done, info
    end
